#. "Devices" is the name of a page in Jellyfin's own dashboard. Use whatever
#. Jellyfin's translation calls that page.
#: src/app.rs:12025
msgid "The server could not be reached, so it still lists this device and the token still works. Remove TinePlayer under Devices in the Jellyfin dashboard to end it there."
